  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Description",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "heading"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The Schedule can show a unit's VIN on the shift blocks. In Month view the blocks are small and the specification says the VIN is deliberately left off there. Month view shows it anyway, which crowds the block and pushes the job description out of sight.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Steps to reproduce",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "heading"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ],
       "text": "Environment: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "QA branch sv8685 \u2014 https://sv8685.qa.shopview.com/schedule. Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin, with the location Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 selected.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Open Schedule.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Open the FILTER & DISPLAY dropdown in the toolbar and turn the VIN Number switch ON. It is off by default, so this step is needed.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Choose Week view with the Day / Week / Month control and read the blocks. The VIN appears, which is correct.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Switch to Month view and read the blocks. The week of 2 to 8 August 2026 on this shop already holds several units with a VIN recorded, so no extra test data is needed.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "Switch to Day view and read them again. The VIN appears there too, which is also correct.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "orderedList"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Current behaviour",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "heading"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With the VIN Number switch on, Month view prints the VIN on the blocks that have one \u2014 11 of 67 blocks carried a full 17-character VIN.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Read straight off Month view blocks: 'Xiriver Apparel ~ 24069 ~ 3HSDZAPT9KN042164 ~ 19 Lines ~ Part of a series', 'Xiriver Apparel ~ 16604 ~ 2H9U7A228VA048027 ~ Service - Wheels off single or tandem axle', and 'Pamill Paving ~ 713 ~ 3HAEUMMP1NL291283 ~ Replace - Rear ramp handles'.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Week view (29 of 55 blocks) and Day view (6 of 12) are both correct. Not every block shows a VIN, because not every unit has one recorded \u2014 the fault is that any VIN appears in Month view at all.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With the switch off, no block in any view shows a VIN, so the switch itself is working and this is specific to Month view.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Expected behaviour",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "heading"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Month view blocks show no VIN at all, even with the switch on.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Source",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "heading"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Epic SV-8685, story SV-8690 (Shift Block Anatomy & Scope Labeling), and the Schedule specification (Confluence page 713031682), version 25.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Section 4.4, of the VIN line: \"Line 3 (optional): VIN number, visible only when the VIN toggle is on in Filter and Display. Shown in day and week views only; month view omits it due to space constraints.\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
